While Master Summoner is active, when a creature you summon appears in the world, it will trigger a wild effect:

*  Ritch Flamespitter: Reduce fire resistance of all foes in the radius by [25%, 33%, 40%, 46%, 51% (TL1-5; MP 100)]
*  Hydra: Generates a cloud of lingering poison, poisoning all foes caught within for [13, 18, 21, 24, 27 (TL1-5; MP 100)] nature damage per turn (cumulative)
*  Rimebark: Reduce cold resistance of all foes in the radius by [25%, 33%, 40%, 46%, 51% (TL1-5; MP 100)]
*  Fire Drake: Appears with [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] fire drake hatchling(s)
*  War Hound: Reduce physical resistance of all foes in the radius by [25%, 33%, 40%, 46%, 51% (TL1-5; MP 100)]
*  Jelly: Reduce nature resistance of all foes in the radius by [25%, 33%, 40%, 46%, 51% (TL1-5; MP 100)]
*  Minotaur: Reduces movement speed of all foes in the radius by [44%, 50%, 54%, 57%, 60% (TL1-5; MP 100)]
*  Stone Golem: Dazes all foes in the radius
*  Turtle: Heals all friendly targets in the radius [246, 321, 379, 428, 472 (TL1-5; MP 100)] HP
*  Spider: Pins all foes in the radius

Radius for effects is [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)], and the duration of each lasting effect is [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns.

The effects improve with your mindpower.
